
###  GET ALL RESERVATIONS
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/reservation/get-all
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
X-Building-Id: {{buildingId}}

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/reservation/get-all?studentId=7
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
X-Building-Id: {{buildingId}}

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/payment/get-all?reservationId=1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
X-Building-Id: {{buildingId}}